","python-requests","requests"],"visibility":"public","forks":9772,"open_issues":306,"watchers":53865,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/requests/pulls/7236","html_url":"https://github.com/psf/requests/pull/7236","diff_url":"https://github.com/psf/requests/pull/7236.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/psf/requests/pull/7236.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Fixes #4965\r\n\r\n## Summary\r\nWhen a streamed response read fails (for example, invalid or incomplete chunked transfer), Requests raises on the first read, but subsequent reads can return empty content instead of raising again.\r\n\r\nThis patch preserves the first read failure and replays it consistently across repeated read attempts.\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\n\r\n- Add `Response._content_error` to store the first stream read exception  \r\n  https://github.com/Takrim-ScrubAI/requests/blob/fix-4965-response-read-error-replay/src/requests/models.py#L646-L669\r\n\r\n- Update `Response.iter_content()` to cache and replay read exceptions  \r\n  https://github.com/Takrim-ScrubAI/requests/blob/fix-4965-response-read-error-replay/src/requests/models.py#L818-L859\r\n\r\n- Update `Response.content` to re-raise cached exceptions  \r\n  https://github.com/Takrim-ScrubAI/requests/blob/fix-4965-response-read-error-replay/src/requests/models.py#L902-L909\r\n\r\n- Add regression helper for read API coverage  \r\n  https://github.com/Takrim-ScrubAI/requests/blob/fix-4965-response-read-error-replay/tests/test_requests.py#L66-L82\r\n\r\n- Add replay regression tests  \r\n  https://github.com/Takrim-ScrubAI/requests/blob/fix-4965-response-read-error-replay/tests/test_requests.py#L1524-L1554\r\n\r\n## Behavior After This Change\r\n\r\nIf the first content read fails, all subsequent content read APIs also fail with the same cached exception, instead of returning empty content.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/requests/issues/7236/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/requests/issues/7236/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]